        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Wario's Woods is a puzzle game similar to Tetris or Columns, but with a twist. Instead of directly controlling the monsters and bombs that are falling down, the player controls Toad who has to carry around stacks of monsters and bombs and to combine them in the right way. One bomb plus at least two monsters of the same color have to be combined to make them disappear. If five or more objects are cleared at the same time, a diamond will appear. Destroying the diamond will clear all monsters of the diamond's color.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Wario's Woods es un juego de puzles similar a Tetris o Columns, pero con un giro. En lugar de controlar directamente los monstruos y las bombas que caen, el jugador controla a Toad, que debe cargar pilas de monstruos y bombas y combinarlas de la manera correcta. Una bomba más al menos dos monstruos del mismo color deben combinarse para hacerlos desaparecer. Si se eliminan cinco o más objetos al mismo tiempo, aparece un diamante. Destruir el diamante elimina a todos los monstruos del color del diamante.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "1994",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
