        },
        {
          "field": "original_name",
          "value": "Wario World",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "While Wario enjoys the riches from his many adventures, a mysterious black jewel in his trove transforms gems into monsters. Now, Wario must scramble to recover his riches in an alternate world filled with quirky puzzles, swarming enemies, and lots of loot. As Wario, you'll punch, kick, jump, grab monsters and objects, and inhale surrounding coins like a vacuum cleaner. You must cling to 3D balls to fight bosses, find hidden areas through trap doors, and bash your surroundings to uncover secrets.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Mientras Wario disfruta de las riquezas de sus muchas aventuras, una misteriosa joya negra en su tesoro convierte las gemas en monstruos. Ahora Wario debe apresurarse a recuperar sus riquezas en un mundo alternativo lleno de extravagantes rompecabezas, enemigos que se agolpan y montones de botín. Como Wario, podrás golpear, patear, saltar, agarrar monstruos y objetos, e inhalar las monedas que te rodean como una aspiradora. Debes aferrarte a bolas 3D para enfrentarte a los jefes, encontrar áreas ocultas a través de trampillas y destrozar tu entorno para descubrir secretos.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2003",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
